          "text": "I authorize this practice to release information required to process insurance claims and I assign payable benefits to the practice. I understand that vision plans typically cover a refraction and materials benefit while medical insurance covers disease-related eye care. I am responsible for copays, deductibles, non-covered services (including refraction when not a plan benefit), and amounts my plan does not pay.",
